    "chunk_text": "hy sceoldan herigean, & forletan on d\u00e6dan \u00fe\u00e6t hy scoldan healdan, & & for\u00f0am sceal geweor\u00f0an, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, to so\u00f0e ic eow secge, eower eard weste & eac eowre burga mid \u00c6l\u00f0eodige men eow sculon hergian, & \u00f0onne ge gebidda\u00fe & to me clypia\u00f0, nelle ic eow gehyran, Gyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsyngodre \u00feeode. BE REAFLACUM Ve impio in malum, et reliqua. Wa manfullan, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, for his misd\u00e6dan: edlean his weorca eal he sceal habban. Min folc is beryped, he cw\u00e6\u00f0 eac, \u00feurh gytsiende reaferas; & wr\u00e6ccena reaflac is on heora hamum, & Gyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsyngodre \u00f0eode. BE IDELUM RENCUM. Pro eo quod eleuate sunt filie Sion, et reliqua. For ofermettan, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, & idelan rencan eowra leoda \u00fee spilia\u00f0 & plega\u00f0 & r\u00e6des ne heda\u00f0, God Gyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsyngodre \u00feeode. BE GITSUNGE. Ve qui coniungitis domum ad domum, et reliqua. Wa eow, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fee lecga\u00f0 tog\u00e6dere hamas & \u00e6hta on unriht begytene on \u00e6ghwilce healfe. Wene ge \u00fe\u00e6t ge sylfe wealdan & wunian swa lange swa ge willan on \u00f0am \u00fee we nu syn? Ac so\u00f0 is \u00fe\u00e6t ic secge, ge hit al\u00e6ta\u00f0 \u00feonne ge l\u00e6st wena\u00f0. Gyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s",
